 "schema": 1,
 "_note": "Core role vocabulary. Brand profiles map these to a design system's own names; builders ask for roles, never brand names. An optional role the brand leaves unmapped takes its fallback role's value, or core's default (neutral: transparent, none, a plain margin); roles with neither are only read by a brand's own code or by markup that asks for them. A role only one brand's own layers or ornaments read is that brand's, named own-<kind>-<name> in its profile; it resolves like a core role (CSS --own-<kind>-<name>, B.color/B.asset) and core never reads it. A dark role with from_dark first takes that role's value in the design system's own dark theme (another theme whose surface is dark), before its fallback.",
